      "writtenOn": "2021-08-30T21:32:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason for SkARGB32_Shader_Blitter::blitMask not supporting shaders with non-src-over xfer modes with anything other than a8 is that SkXfermode::xfer32 only supports A8. The local \u0027blend_row\u0027 is essentially an out-of-line set of specializations for SkXfermode::xfer32 for src-over.\n\nSince the legacy blitters do not support all mask formats with all blend modes, they will either need to be fixed or not chosen.",
      "parentUuid": "aa09448a_875483f0",
